    "detailed_description": "Full Speed \u200b\u200bAnimals Disorder is a game where you can blow away almost anything.<br />\r\nYou can ram it and send it flying, send missiles to send it flying, or just send it flying by itself.<br />\r\nAvoid beams from UFOs or run away from something to avoid being caught up.<br />\r\nThis world is not Earth, it is a story about returning to Earth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is quite difficult.<br />\r\nThe slightest mistake can lead to a game over, will you be able to clear the game?<br />\r\nIt is also ideal for use as an RTA for each character.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, after the game is over, there will be a mission...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0How to operate<br />\r\n-W/UpArrow: Previous/Up<br />\r\n-A/LeftArrow:Left<br />\r\n-S/DownArrow:Back/Down<br />\r\n-D/RightArrow: Right<br />\r\n-Space:Skill activation/confirmation<br />\r\n-R:Missile launch<br />\r\n-LeftClick: Confirm<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Game over conditions<br />\r\n-Flying high in the sky<br />\r\n-time up<br />\r\n-Falling<br />\r\n-If someone catches up with you",
